{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hungry Lily &amp; the Fallen Knight is a platform 2D game with a twist. you start off as a weak sausage dog named Lily as she finds her way in a new world jumping platform to platform getting more stronger each level and having new powers. collecting sprats as her favourite treat. you have to dodge enemies, land on moving playforms, make hard jumps and jumps based on time. in the end game dungeons lvl 9+ there is special skills and enemies you can fight due to getting stronger. The game also has a storyline and more lvls will be added during early access.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645880?t=1744381266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645880/4573ae70eb3c5cdfd6826b5ac587a66ef1ac679a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744381266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645880/8f77e9fa332ab26ceca220297986a9adbcbd8e2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744381266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645880/8f77e9fa332ab26ceca220297986a9adbcbd8e2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744381266","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hungry Lily &amp; the Fallen Knight is a platform 2D game with a twist. you start off as a weak sausage dog named Lily as she finds her way in a new world jumping platform to platform getting more stronger each level and having new powers. collecting sprats as her favourite treat. you have to dodge enemies, land on moving playforms, make hard jumps and jumps based on time. in the end game dungeons lvl 9+ there is special skills and enemies you can fight due to getting stronger. The game also has a storyline and more lvls will be added during early access.</p>","developers":["Joshua Shaw"]